        {
          "event_id": "violet-bfdc33ea8f:e00292",
          "branch_id": "b0",
          "command": "",
          "response": "\"No, Violet.  What are we going to do with you?  My turn is done.  It's the \nonly fair thing.\"\n\"You've been miserable.  You'll be happier this way.\"\n\"I'm already happier.  Today made it so clear.  This is not what I'm meant to \nbe doing with my life.  I know, I've spent six years in graduate school, I \nshould be crying right now.  Instead I feel wonderful.  I love you so much.\"\n\nMe too, wallaroo.\n\nThree weeks later we are holding hands in the supereconomy section of a flight \nto Australia.  My brother is lending me money to open a curiosities shop.  He's \nfound you a job at a comic book shop until you decide what's next.\n\n                                   violet\n                          (you are my FAVOURITE!)\n* * *",
